          "changelog": "- Initial store release.\n- Now, Week, Details and Places screens: big serif temperature, next hours,\n  8-day forecast with a temperature curve, and saved places with their own\n  sky, local time and temperature.\n- Animated sky backdrops that follow the weather and time of day, with rain,\n  snow, stars, mist and lightning on a single canvas.\n- Forecasts from Open-Meteo (free, no API key), current location from the\n  phone's GPS, saved cities from the companion settings page.\n- Knob scrubs through the next 24 hours on Now; top button refreshes."
